'''Cruelty''' is a [[buff]] associated with {{il|Cruelty Support}} that grants more [[damage over time]] to supported skills.

==Mechanics==
Cruelty grants more [[damage over time]] with supported skills based on the [[damage]] of the [[hit]] compared to the target's maximum [[life]]. It lasts 4 seconds by default, and has a maximum effect of 40%. The maximum is unaffected by modifiers to Cruelty effect.<ref name="CrueltyCap"/>

At gem level 20, The Cruelty buff provides 15.85% more damage over time to skills supported by Cruelty when the hit does 0.01% of the monster's [[Ailment#Ailment_threshold|ailment threshold]] and 40% more damage over time to skills supported by Cruelty when the hit does 3.2% of the monster's ailment threshold.<ref name="CrueltyCalculations"/> Taking Shaper's 7 million ailment threshold<ref name="ShaperAilmentThreshold"/> as an example, a hit of 224k is needed to reach the maximum buff of 40%.{{confirm|changes since introduction}} 

The effect of Cruelty is calculated using the following formula:{{citation needed}}

{{math|formula=
E ={1 + M \over 120\%} * \left({D \over L}\right)^{0.2}
}}

where D is the is the amount of damage caused by a hit, L is the enemy's maximum life, and M is the sum of increases to Cruelty effect.

